# A corrupted AGENTS.md mirror, moved out of the repo root on 2026-08-14.
# Kept rather than deleted (standing rule: nothing is deleted, obsolete files go
# to attic/), but kept OUT of git, the same way the archived first-run database
# in attic/ is -- present on this machine, absent from a clone.
#
# It was a stale copy of CLAUDE.md from mid-M1 with "claude" string-replaced by
# "Codex", which corrupted the three places that word appears inside a real path
# or package name: it told the reader the deny list lives at .Codex/settings.json
# and the skills come from superpowers@Codex-plugins-official. Neither exists.
#
# AGENTS.md is a real convention that some agent tooling reads as authoritative,
# and this file was NOT gitignored while it sat at the repo root -- so it was
# both readable as instructions and one `git add -A` away from being committed
# as if it were guidance. Investigated 2026-08-14: no hook, script, or plugin in
# this repo or in user-scope settings generates it, and CLAUDE.md is the only
# file that references it, so it will not reappear on its own.
#
# The repo-root path is left free deliberately: a correct AGENTS.md could be
# written there later. CLAUDE.md remains the authority either way.
attic/AGENTS.md.corrupt-2026-08-14

# A stray, byte-identical duplicate of src/score/overrides.ts that was written
# to the repo ROOT by mistake during M2 task 6. Dead where it landed — its
# `../domain/item.ts` import only resolves from src/score/ — and moved to attic/
# rather than deleted, per the standing never-delete rule.
#
# Note for anyone reasoning about attic/: it is NOT blanket-gitignored. Only
# specific patterns are (`*.db`, `*.db-wal`, `*.db-shm` above), which is why the
# archived first-run database sits there untracked while a stray .ts would not.
# Each non-matching file put there needs its own line here, or it stays visible
# in `git status` as an untracked file forever.
attic/overrides.ts.stray-2026-08-14

# A sed backup left by a mutation-testing step during M3 task 5. Preserved
# (never delete) but kept out of git, like the other attic strays above.
attic/sources.ts.bak2-mutation-test-2026-08-14

# A route-table debug script written to the repo ROOT during M3 task 7's
# manual verification pass (server.printRoutes() against a scratch DB copy,
# to confirm the frontend proxy's paths matched the /api prefix a concurrent
# commit had just added). Served its purpose, moved to attic/ rather than
# deleted, kept out of git like the other attic strays above.
attic/wf-route-debug.mjs.task7-scratch-2026-08-14

# The VACUUM INTO scratch copy of data/wf.db made for the same manual
